{"name":"Answer new website leads from a webhook with OpenAI, Gmail and Slack","nodes":[{"id":"4ad009a9-725a-4c93-8ba0-a6b1be2fbab9","name":"Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-980,-340],"parameters":{"width":520,"height":600,"content":"## Answer new website leads in a minute\n\n### How it works\nWhen someone sends your website form, the webhook passes the enquiry to OpenAI. It labels the request type and urgency and drafts a reply using the services and hours in the Settings node. Gmail sends the reply, Slack tells your team, and the lead is saved in Google Sheets. After two days, leads still marked New get one follow up.\n\n### Setup\n1. Send your website form to the webhook address in the first node. It expects the fields name, email, phone and message.\n2. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named Leads and the columns Date, Name, Email, Phone, Message, Type, Urgency, Status.\n3. Add your OpenAI, Gmail, Slack and Google Sheets credentials to the nodes.\n4. Fill in the Settings node: sheet ID, business name, services, hours, Slack channel.\n5. Send a test enquiry, then activate.\n\n### Customization tips\nChange the follow up delay in the Wait node or add a text message for urgent requests."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1e126c89-1437-4607-8950-bbfa64a7a675","name":"Section: receive","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-420,-120],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":460,"height":300,"content":"## Receive the enquiry\nYour website form posts here."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"063c91d0-1190-4ca1-afcc-c5cc7b74cb7a","name":"Section: understand","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[60,-120],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":260,"height":300,"content":"## Understand and draft the reply\nLabels the request and writes a personal answer."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8b0c21f7-5b15-4542-b2f6-fdc073a51d8b","name":"Section: reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[340,-120],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":480,"height":300,"content":"## Reply and alert the team\nThe customer hears back in a minute and your team sees it in Slack."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"509c56af-697d-4b81-a190-c4b5bc1f5499","name":"Section: follow up","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[840,-120],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1180,"height":300,"content":"## Log and follow up\nSaves the lead, then nudges once if it is still New after two days."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"366657e2-db9a-4d50-9ad3-23b655f8c615","name":"New website enquiry","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-360,0],"webhookId":"c4a5c4d1-4eb0-4149-9d36-ba3e4eee4eae","parameters":{"path":"new-website-lead","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"2d29de6a-2cb8-474b-8a5b-282cf45c831b","name":"Settings","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[-140,0],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"b9f36ce8-dd1a-4427-8bbb-8651b0481861","name":"sheetId","type":"string","value":"PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"},{"id":"12aba736-606b-4c4d-93ef-70959c296faa","name":"businessName","type":"string","value":"Your Business Name"},{"id":"747e4421-d940-404e-a933-98aee37e97e6","name":"services","type":"string","value":"List your services here, for example: plumbing repairs, water heaters, drain cleaning"},{"id":"8690c8fe-92f7-42eb-a637-a267505370a4","name":"openingHours","type":"string","value":"Monday to Friday, 8 am to 6 pm"},{"id":"aee4291c-aba2-4a0c-97eb-4fdb4db4c972","name":"slackChannel","type":"string","value":"new-leads"},{"id":"03aef056-d24f-4f70-95ec-86d14ecf11b4","name":"replyTo","type":"string","value":"user@example.com"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"84f742f4-e5ba-49c5-91a2-5e94503a72df","name":"Understand and draft the reply","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[120,0],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O-MINI"},"options":{},"messages":{"values":[{"role":"system","content":"=You answer new enquiries for {{ $json.businessName }}. Services: {{ $json.services }}. Opening hours: {{ $json.openingHours }}. Reply with JSON only, using the keys requestType, urgency (one of: urgent, normal), replySubject, replyBody and followUpBody. replyBody is plain text, under 110 words, friendly and specific to what the person asked, and says a team member will confirm details during opening hours. followUpBody is a two sentence nudge for later. Never quote a price, a date or a promise that is not given to you."},{"content":"=Name: {{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.name }}\nEmail: {{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.email }}\nPhone: {{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.phone }}\nMessage: {{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.message }}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"71ae1528-b444-41ae-aa60-dd3395c87437","name":"Send the reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[400,0],"parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.email }}","message":"={{ $json.message.content.replyBody }}","options":{"replyTo":"={{ $('Settings').item.json.replyTo }}","appendAttribution":false},"subject":"={{ $json.message.content.replySubject }}","emailType":"text"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"4c381644-42c0-42b7-ac2d-929aa4aefa96","name":"Tell the team in Slack","type":"n8n-nodes-base.slack","position":[640,0],"parameters":{"text":"=New enquiry ({{ $('Understand and draft the reply').item.json.message.content.urgency }}): {{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.name }}, {{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.phone }}\nAbout: {{ $('Understand and draft the reply').item.json.message.content.requestType }}\n\"{{ $('New website enquiry').item.json.body.message }}\"\nA first reply has been sent.","select":"channel","channelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Settings').item.json.slackChannel }}"},"otherOptions":{}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"ef39946a-6ee7-408f-abd8-789d4a64afcb","name":"Save the lead","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[900,0],"parameters":{"columns":{"val